{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"youngII"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WellTemperament"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Six consecutive fifths from C to F♯ — C→G, G→D, D→A, A→E, E→B, B→F♯ — are each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"narrowed by ⅙ of the Pythagorean comma, equal to 2^(13\/6)\/3 ≈ 698.045 cents.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The remaining six fifths are pure (3:2). The circle closes exactly.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The tempered fifth size is identical to Vallotti, but the tempered segment runs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from C through F♯ (six sharps) rather than from F through B (six naturals\/flats).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Published in ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Philosophical Transactions of the Royal Society","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 90 (1800)."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"IvorTuning"}],"title":"youngII","roleHeading":"Type Property","externalID":"s:10IvorTuning0B6SystemPA2A15WellTemperamentVRszrlE7youngIIAEvpZ::SYNTHESIZED::s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice"